Spec: Change Boundary Schema

Purpose:
  Define the machine-readable Change Boundary v1 JSON contract for feature-scoped SpecDD authority projection.

Owns:
  ./change-boundary.schema.json

Must:
  Unresolved target entries require `input`, `code`, and `message`.
  The unresolved `code` is one of `INVALID_TARGET`, `UNRESOLVED_TARGET`, `INTENDED_TARGET_UNSUPPORTED`, `RESOLUTION_FAILED`, or `AMBIGUOUS_AUTHORITY`.
  Human-readable unresolved `message` text remains descriptive and is not the machine-readable diagnostic identifier.
  Generation metadata records SpecDD CLI and framework versions.

Done when:
  Generated and loaded Change Boundary documents validate stable unresolved diagnostic codes independently of message text.
